# Who this application is, in one place: the build script makes the bundle's Info.plist and its
# signature from these three lines. The system hangs permissions (the local network) on the
# identifier, so it changes at most once, and only here.
#
# Decided by the owner (2026-11-17). The name may still change after a trademark search; then
# it changes here.
BUNDLE_ID=com.maromoco.istesso
APP_NAME=Istesso
EXECUTABLE=Istesso

# The measuring build: the same program with a local way in for the measurement's keys
# (ADR 0018). A development helper, named so and with an identifier of its own, so that it is
# never taken for the application that is handed out.
MEASURING_BUNDLE_ID=com.maromoco.istesso-dev.measure
MEASURING_APP_NAME="Istesso Dev Measure"
MEASURING_EXECUTABLE="Istesso Dev Measure"
